# Contexte Docker minimal pour deploy/server.Dockerfile (BuildKit).
# Only the Rust workspace sources, the manifests and the Cargo config are sent to
# the builder: target/, spikes/ and extension/ are left out.

.git
.github
.phase0
.cargo/registry
target
**/target
spikes
extension
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
data
**/data
docs
# Seul le panneau admin (static/admin) est copié dans l'image runtime.
static/*
!static/admin
deploy
*.log
**/*.log
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
.env
.env.*
.vscode
.idea
